{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/42502b5f91709253438d8bccb1573db6.poster.avif?t=1772140471\" aria-label=\"A montage of combat sequences.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/42502b5f91709253438d8bccb1573db6.webm?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/42502b5f91709253438d8bccb1573db6.mp4?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guinea Pig Gunner is a run-and-gun platformer with boomer shooter DNA. It fuses precision platforming with a massive arsenal of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/4be4f30bc46679e8a527433833da71fa.poster.avif?t=1772140471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/4be4f30bc46679e8a527433833da71fa.webm?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/4be4f30bc46679e8a527433833da71fa.mp4?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teleporter gun lets you solve platforming and combat challenges in unique and interesting ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/6c5ef54406424078cc62b46e17fe838a.poster.avif?t=1772140471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/6c5ef54406424078cc62b46e17fe838a.webm?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/6c5ef54406424078cc62b46e17fe838a.mp4?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jump, wall jump, and dash lets you move through hostile terrain with style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Backstory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 22nd century, the Federation of Earth deploys its ultimate weapon: Gunner, a cyborg guinea pig built to repel the Terranublans, a fanatical reptilian race that worships a rogue AI bent on galactic conquest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring the Firepower:</strong> Rockets, grenades, flamethrowers, firebombs, and more. Over half a dozen weapons give you plenty of ways to shred enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim Anywhere:</strong> Full 360 degree aiming with mouse or controller for precise, responsive combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleport to Victory:</strong> Blink through walls, telefrag enemies, ambush squads, and solve environmental puzzles with your teleporter gun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies That Hunt You:</strong> Terranublan forces chase you down on sight, striking from the air and ground, forcing constant movement and quick reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay and Mastery:</strong> Hidden secrets, branching paths, and combat variety encourage experimentation, exploration, and speedrunning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guinea Pig Gunner is a side scrolling shooter unlike anything you've ever played. Fast movement, a deep arsenal, aggressive enemies, and layers of replayability combine into a fresh, high intensity action experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996660?t=1772140471","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/92c4a14cbf1868404c8a9e15191508589469e671/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772140471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/d64e86890110c1b34fd23052ac445138c354caea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772140471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/d64e86890110c1b34fd23052ac445138c354caea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772140471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/42502b5f91709253438d8bccb1573db6.poster.avif?t=1772140471\" aria-label=\"A montage of combat sequences.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/42502b5f91709253438d8bccb1573db6.webm?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/42502b5f91709253438d8bccb1573db6.mp4?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guinea Pig Gunner is a run-and-gun platformer with boomer shooter DNA. It fuses precision platforming with a massive arsenal of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/4be4f30bc46679e8a527433833da71fa.poster.avif?t=1772140471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/4be4f30bc46679e8a527433833da71fa.webm?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/4be4f30bc46679e8a527433833da71fa.mp4?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teleporter gun lets you solve platforming and combat challenges in unique and interesting ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/6c5ef54406424078cc62b46e17fe838a.poster.avif?t=1772140471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/6c5ef54406424078cc62b46e17fe838a.webm?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/extras/6c5ef54406424078cc62b46e17fe838a.mp4?t=1772140471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jump, wall jump, and dash lets you move through hostile terrain with style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Backstory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 22nd century, the Federation of Earth deploys its ultimate weapon: Gunner, a cyborg guinea pig built to repel the Terranublans, a fanatical reptilian race that worships a rogue AI bent on galactic conquest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring the Firepower:</strong> Rockets, grenades, flamethrowers, firebombs, and more. Over half a dozen weapons give you plenty of ways to shred enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim Anywhere:</strong> Full 360 degree aiming with mouse or controller for precise, responsive combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleport to Victory:</strong> Blink through walls, telefrag enemies, ambush squads, and solve environmental puzzles with your teleporter gun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies That Hunt You:</strong> Terranublan forces chase you down on sight, striking from the air and ground, forcing constant movement and quick reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay and Mastery:</strong> Hidden secrets, branching paths, and combat variety encourage experimentation, exploration, and speedrunning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guinea Pig Gunner is a side scrolling shooter unlike anything you've ever played. Fast movement, a deep arsenal, aggressive enemies, and layers of replayability combine into a fresh, high intensity action experience.</p>","developers":["Glowmatic LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996660/2da438a3cbc3dceff91ff8a3542d9d55d7a4e73d/header.jpg?t=1772140471","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.0 compatible GPU</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 64-bit or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with Metal 3 support</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"